  "Zone {zone}/{total}, salvage {salvage}/{target}, and oxygen {oxygen}/{max} will be discarded.": "Zone {zone}/{total}, Bergung {salvage}/{target} und Sauerstoff {oxygen}/{max} werden verworfen.",
